      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">二、非选择题：本题共4小题，共58分。</section><br>10. <img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/0b3d511c0e404cf58e83.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">(四羰合镍，沸点43℃)可用于制备高纯镍，也是有机化合物羰基化反应的催化剂。回答下列问题：<br>（1）Ni基态原子价电子的轨道表示式为_______。镍的晶胞结构类型与铜的相同，晶胞体积为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/43406a5a658f5899f293.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，镍原子半径为_______。<br>（2）<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/0b3d511c0e404cf58e83.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">结构如图甲所示，其中含有σ键<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/350d3d039e4217854705.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">数目为_______，晶体的类型为_______。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/660709147acde5c4b510.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（3）在总压分别为0.10、0.50、1.0、2.0MPa下，Ni(s)和CO(g)反应达平衡时，<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/0b3d511c0e404cf58e83.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">体积分数x与温度的关系如图乙所示。反应<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/b0f5d620121246e4c176.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">的ΔH_______0(填“大于”或“小于”)。从热力学角度考虑，_______有利于的生成(写出两点)。<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/9c15764a66a7488bbb9c.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、100℃时CO的平衡转化率α=_______，该温度下平衡常数<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/799b4e23cbc835aa31f9.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">_______<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/d8fe5398dd4eaceadcda.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/73b03197ffb0a5a46608.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（4）对于同位素交换反应<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/aa2505f0e017539d14bf.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，20℃时反应物浓度随时间的变化关系为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/5d15f1508fa3be600a05.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">(k为反应速率常数)，则<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/acf8a7753ec2a5ea9552.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">反应一半所需时间<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/chemistry/8a7a45ec7bbdbba1e663.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">_______(用k表示)。",
